do GameState.start_minigame()
[background arg="res://assets/Minigame/Minigame_1.png" fade="1.0" transition="Push Up"]
audio music "res://audio/higheruniversalman-take-me-out-to-the-ball-game-sports-stadium-crowd-music-506221.mp3" [volume="-14.0" loop="true"]
join Juniper center
[wait time="1.5"]
Lizzy: I know it sounds crazy, but trust me.
Lizzy: I can prove it.
Juniper: ...
label Journal Select
do MenuManager.open_journal()
[wait_input]
if {is_success} == true:
	do MinegameTest.update_background("strikes_number")
	if {current_item} == "silver_nugget":
		Lizzy: Before all this crazy time loop stuff started, you dropped this strange nugget thing.
		Lizzy: And now I have it because stuff in my pockets travels with me every time I loop.
		Lizzy: I haven’t been able to figure that out yet.
		Juniper: You shouldn’t be holding that...
		Lizzy: Exactly, if there wasn’t a time loop, how would I have it?
		Juniper: It’s dangerous.
		Lizzy: Wait, really?
		Lizzy: Is it like radioactive or something?
		Juniper: Lizzy
		Juniper: Just, stop this, okay?
		VO: What is with her?
		VO: She’s totally not acting like herself.
	
	
	elif {current_item} == "acceptance_letter":
		Lizzy: I found this in the hallway,
		Lizzy: It’s your acceptance to Emmerdale.
		Juniper: You weren’t supposed to see that.
		Lizzy: In a previous loop you lied to me about getting in.
		Juniper: I...
		Juniper: It’s for the best.
		Lizzy: You don’t have to protect my feelings, Jay.
		Lizzy: I’m proud of you.
		Juniper (Sad Face): ...
		Juniper (Sad Face): It’s not that...
		Juniper: You wouldn’t understand...
		VO: Hm. It doesn’t seem to be working.
	
	
	elif {current_item} == "j_clairvoyance":
		Lizzy: Valerie said that this time loop is probably messing with your powers.
		Lizzy: Have you noticed anything strange or weird?
		Lizzy: Like dizziness or trouble staying awake or maybe vomiting?
		Juniper: You’re just describing random medical symptoms.
		Lizzy: I don’t know what psychic sickness looks like, okay?
		Juniper: I’m fine.
		Juniper: Nothing is wrong.
	
	set {strikes_number} += 1.0
	join Item leftmost [animation="Zoom In" length="9.0"]
	leave Item [animation="Slide To Right" length="1.1" wait="true"]
	if {strikes_number} == 1.0:
		[background arg="res://assets/Minigame/Minigame_2.png" fade="0.0" transition="Simple Fade"]
	elif {strikes_number} == 2.0:
		[background arg="res://assets/Minigame/Minigame_3.png" fade="0.0" transition="Simple Fade"]
	elif {strikes_number} == 3.0:
		[background arg="res://assets/Minigame/Minigame_4.png" fade="0.0" transition="Simple Fade"]
	[wait time="1.5"]
else:
	Juniper: …
	VO: This isn’t getting through to her.

set {is_success} = false
if {strikes_number} < 3.0:
	jump Journal Select
[background fade="2.0" wait="true"]
audio music - [fade="4.0"]
update Juniper [animation="Shake X"]
Juniper: [something something getting mad about stuff]
leave Juniper [animation="Slide To Left" wait="true"]
join  center
Lizzy: [insert lizzy line]
join Dagger center [animation="Fade In Up"]
Dagger: i'm here now! that's crazy that thing you just said...
jump minigame_d_5/